# Example cmdmenu config.  Indent = nesting (4 spaces per level).
# leaf:  Name => shell command      menu:  Name

Disks
    Open /dev/sda       => crym2 -a open -d /dev/sda -c yes
    Close /dev/sda      => crym2 -a close -d /dev/sda
    Show devices        => lsblk -f

Sync
    Home -> disk A      => sync2 <HASH-A>
    Unmount all         => umoall

System
    Uptime              => uptime
    Disk usage          => df -h
    Memory
        Summary         => free -h
        Top processes   => ps aux --sort=-%mem | head
